  "sourceInterpretation": "Public IDF6.1 fff9895c82d744c7237be8847347bdd1b07c6643 marks S31 FPU memory EXT_ILL bug; vectors.S fallback additionally tests a P4-only revision option. Original image reports private v6.1-dirty. Official emulator0.51.0 actually supplies FPU reason1 for all six forms. This establishes upstream compatibility,not silicon behavior or matching private SDK.",
  "semantics": {
    "default": "Strict default unchanged,reason0 for FSOff FP loads/stores. Option must be explicit.",
    "optIn": "After a real FSOff illegal-instruction trap,decode mtval using actual MISA; only FLW/FSW including compressed forms OR the FPU reason bit. Counts perhart.",
    "preserved": "No PC/FS/mepc/mtval/register repair; trap remains visible. Guest handler must read reason,enable FS,mret and retry. Other illegal instructions/data faults unchanged. Shared CPU code untouched.",
    "unsupported": [
      "Measured silicon behavior or exact private SDK revision",
      "Crypto-domain startup clock/reset controls at next actual access",
      "Plus board/display/complete application readiness"
    ]
  },
